# Native macOS dependencies

This build uses dynamically linked Qt @Qt6_VERSION@, FluidSynth @FLUIDSYNTH_VERSION@ and their runtime dependencies. Qt Core, GUI, Widgets, Network, Concurrent and Multimedia are used. Their library versions must match the deployed plugin versions.

Qt is Copyright The Qt Company Ltd. and contributors. LGPLv3 and GPLv3 texts are under `licenses/`. Corresponding Qt source modules, including their bundled third-party notices, are available at https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/@Qt6_VERSION_MAJOR@.@Qt6_VERSION_MINOR@/@Qt6_VERSION@/submodules/ . Native Qt build provenance and component information are recorded in the included SBOM files. Homebrew formula/build scripts are at https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core . See https://doc.qt.io/qt-@Qt6_VERSION_MAJOR@.@Qt6_VERSION_MINOR@/licenses-used-in-qt.html for bundled-component notices.

FluidSynth is LGPL; its notices are under `licenses/fluidsynth/`. Corresponding source is https://github.com/FluidSynth/fluidsynth/releases/tag/v@FLUIDSYNTH_VERSION@ . Native FluidSynth is obtained from Homebrew rather than the Windows runtime referred to by older notices. libsndfile is LGPL; its notices are under `licenses/fluidsynth/`, source https://github.com/libsndfile/libsndfile/releases . Additional copied Homebrew dependencies and their receipt/SBOM data are in `licenses/macos-runtime/`; use the versions and source locations from those receipts when obtaining corresponding source.

Salamander Grand Piano v3: Alexander Holm, SF2 adaptation Roberto/FreePats, CC-BY-3.0. GeneralUser GS 2.0.3: S. Christian Collins. Bravura: Steinberg, SIL OFL 1.1. Their complete tracked notices accompany this application. Original Windows system GM samples are not included.

CrispEmbed v0.17.12 macOS arm64 and ggml: MIT; Transcoda-59M-Q8: CC-BY-4.0, original model by btrkeks, GGUF conversion by CrispStrobe/cstr. Details, source links, model card and licenses are under `tools/omr-native/licenses` when the optional engine is bundled. Optional Whisper and vocal separation components are not included in this Mac baseline.

Recipients may modify and relink LGPL libraries. This app is ad hoc signed and has no private-key installation lock: replace ABI-compatible dylibs/frameworks under `Contents/Frameworks`, preserve their install names, and sign modified nested code and the app with `codesign --force --sign -`. A full rebuild with a different ABI needs this MIT application source from its distributor. See `MACOS.md` for build and signing instructions. Keep all license notices and do not restrict recipients' LGPL rights.
